# hundred-select: password 2 6 5 2 6 5 (all zones cleared: 100-stage mode). The game pauses itself
# as play starts and opens the hidden stage select: Right, Right, Up (stage 13), Cross asks,
# Left/Right move the yes/no cursor, Circle backs out, Cross, Left (yes), Cross: stage 13. Start
# pauses, Cross opens the stage select, Right, Circle cancels (back to the paused stage), Start
# resumes. Pokes then move the game to zone 5 stage 20 and the professor to the goal: the end of
# the 100-stage run (screen 9 step 4), the ending, name entry, the save screen, quit.
poke 800 0x800eebb0 4
poke 800 0x800eeb04 19
poke 800 0x800ee864 15
